{
  "id": "section-overview-of-play",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Overview of play\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,814,831]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You create a character and then\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,831,863]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explore an urban area, represented\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,863,898]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "by a series of “boxes”. You move\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,898,931]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from one location to the next with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,931,966]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a combination of choices and dice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,966,1000]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls. Depending on your mission,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1000,1034]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you may be looking for a way to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1034,1066]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stop the forces of evil from taking\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1066,1102]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "over the world, or just keep\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1102,1131]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "yourself or some loved ones safe.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1131,1165]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Every game you play is a mission.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1165,1199]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Multiple connected missions\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1199,1227]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "played by the same character form\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1227,1261]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a campaign.  You can imagine that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1261,1295]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "every mission is like an episode of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1295,1331]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a TV series, and the campaign is a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1331,1366]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-overview-of-play:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "whole season.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1366,1380]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    5
  ]
}
